---

## 2. Visual State Transition Diagram

The architecture flowchart below illustrates the exact state evolution and execution pathway:

```mermaid
graph TD
  Start["Start Grid Traversal at Cell (r, c)"] --> Check{"Within Grid Bounds and Land?"}
  Check -- No --> Skip["Skip Cell / Backtrack"]
  Check -- Yes --> Mark["Mark Cell Visited in Grid"]
  Mark --> Neighbors["Explore 4 Directions: Up, Down, Left, Right"]
  Neighbors --> Recurse["DFS Recursion / Enqueue to BFS Queue"]
